    "background_story": "Carolina was a free-spirited artist known for her quirky personality and creative genius. However, her friends and family often found her to be annoyingly optimistic, always expecting the best from people and situations. She would burst into song in the middle of conversations, or suddenly decide to take a detour on a road trip to explore a hidden gem. Her relentless enthusiasm could be exhausting, but it was also infectious. Carolina's art studio was a reflection of her whimsical nature, filled with colorful trinkets and eclectic treasures. Despite her annoyingly cheerful demeanor, Carolina's art brought joy to all who experienced it, and her unwavering positivity inspired those around her to see the world through her vibrant lens.",
